Package: com.mohsen.touchguard
Name: CallRevive
Version: 1.0
Description: Experimental call recovery and proximity restoration. Five-minute request limit; may stop earlier on call or audio-route changes. Tested on iPhone SE (2020), iOS 16.4, Relaxin/RootHide. Not a guaranteed fix.
Author: Mohsen Mahmoud
Maintainer: Mohsen Mahmoud
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
